      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-06-02_WidnesExaminer_art0151" n="art0151">
        <head>LIVING WAGE.</head>
        <p>THE LIVING WAGE.</p>
        <p>With proper management,it is surprising how cheaply and comfortably a family can live. The secret lies in choosing the food that goes furthest. Current bread is a delicious, wholesome and nutritious article of diet. The currants double the food worth of the bread, so that persons of limited means can avail themselves of a staple article of diet at much less than the usual cost. Ask your baker for White or or Hovis currant bread.</p>
      </div>
